  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: C6
  Title: UIAnimationAudio.SetShared
  Summary: Replacing the shared source routes every sound step that has no source
    of its own through yours.
  Watch: Speaker; DontDestroyOnLoad in the Hierarchy
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 2113489343}
  HowTo: Enter play mode fresh. Press SetShared first, then Click a few times. Exit,
    enter again, and press Click before SetShared.
  Expect: After SetShared the jingle sounds muffled and no UI Animation Audio object
    appears. Clicking before SetShared plays it clear, from a new UI Animation Audio.
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
