  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: C2
  Title: SetTo, SetFrom, ClearOverrides
  Summary: Values set from code before playing, without touching the Inspector's.
    The tile's own C# properties Level and Coins are animated.
  Watch: the level bar, the coins, the message
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1564074364}
  - {fileID: 675454887}
  - {fileID: 1907708232}
  HowTo: 'In play mode press each button, a few times, reading the lines. Select
    the tile while doing it: the Inspector values never change.'
  Expect: The white line matches the yellow one. +7 coins pressed mid-count still
    lands 7 higher per click. Refused calls returns False three times and logs three
    warnings.
