  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: C3
  Title: IsPlaying, IsAnyPlaying, Has, onComplete
  Summary: The checking calls, read live, and Play's onComplete overload (only on
    a natural finish).
  Watch: Dot, the blue probe lines
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1113593260}
  - {fileID: 722093107}
  HowTo: 'In play mode: Play Pulse and watch the probe. Play with onComplete and
    let it finish. Play with onComplete again, and Stop All before it ends.'
  Expect: IsPlaying("Pulse") and IsAnyPlaying are True only while it pulses; Has("Pulse")
    is always True and Has("Nope") always False. 'callback ran' appears after a natural
    finish, never after Stop All.
  Needs: 2
  Style: 0
